<title>SPAIN: FORECAST-Sevillana 96 net seen up 15.6 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Sevillana 96 net seen up 15.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish electricity firm Sevillana de Electricidad.</p>
<p>Simple averages of analysts forecasts. In billion of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995	 RANGE</p>
<p>    Operating income	293.86	287.47   302.0-283.2</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 20.66	17.59    21.21- 19.00</p>
<p>Contributors: AB Asesores, ABN-Amro, Ahorro Corporacion, Benito y Monjardin, Beta Capital, Credit Lyonnais, Ibersecurities.</p>
<p>Sevillana expects to release its results from mid-February.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
</text>
